---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Patient Information | Insurance, Financing & New Patient Forms | Fallbrook"
  description="New patient information for Downtown Dental Studio in Fallbrook, CA. Learn about insurance, CareCredit financing, Cherry payment plans, VIP memberships, and what to expect at your first visit."
  pageType="business"
>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-avocado-700 to-avocado-800 text-white">
    <div class="container-max section-padding">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 font-[family:var(--font-heading)]">Patient Information</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-avocado-100">Everything you need to know before your first visit.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-max section-padding">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
      <!-- What to Expect -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-avocado-800 mb-6 font-[family:var(--font-heading)]">Your First Visit</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="card">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">1. Warm Welcome</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Our friendly front desk team will greet you, verify your information, and make you feel at home.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">2. Comprehensive Exam</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Dr. Gill will perform a thorough examination, including digital X-rays if needed, and discuss any concerns.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">3. Personalized Treatment Plan</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">We'll create a customized care plan tailored to your needs, goals, and budget — with transparent pricing.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">4. Schedule Follow-Up</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Any needed treatments will be scheduled at your convenience. We respect your time.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 p-6 bg-avocado-50 rounded-xl border border-avocado-200">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-avocado-800 mb-2 font-[family:var(--font-heading)]">📋 What to Bring</h3>
          <ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-2">
            <li>✅ Photo ID</li>
            <li>✅ Insurance card (if applicable)</li>
            <li>✅ List of current medications</li>
            <li>✅ Any recent dental X-rays or records</li>
            <li>✅ Completed new patient forms (or arrive 15 min early)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Insurance & Payment -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-avocado-800 mb-6 font-[family:var(--font-heading)]">Insurance & Payment</h2>

        <div class="card mb-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Insurance</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3">
            We are an <strong>out-of-network PPO provider</strong>, which means we can work with most PPO dental 
            insurance plans. Our team will help you maximize your benefits and handle the coordination of 
            benefits paperwork so you get the most from your coverage.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
            Don't have insurance? <a href="/memberships/" class="text-avocado-600 font-medium hover:underline">Check out our VIP Membership plans</a> — 
            affordable dental care without the insurance hassle.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card mb-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Financing Options</h3>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex gap-3 items-start">
              <span class="text-2xl flex-shrink-0">💳</span>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-medium text-gray-800">CareCredit</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Healthcare financing with flexible payment plans and promotional financing options. Apply online or in-office.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-3 items-start">
              <span class="text-2xl flex-shrink-0">🍒</span>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-medium text-gray-800">Cherry</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Buy now, pay later for dental care. Quick approval, flexible terms, and no hard credit check.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-3 items-start">
              <span class="text-2xl flex-shrink-0">💎</span>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-medium text-gray-800">VIP Membership Plans</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Starting at $39/month. Transparent pricing, no deductibles, no waiting periods. <a href="/memberships/" class="text-avocado-600 hover:underline">Learn more →</a></p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Private Pay</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
            We accept cash, checks, and all major credit cards. We believe in transparent pricing — 
            you'll always know the cost of treatment before we begin.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-avocado-50">
    <div class="container-max px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-avocado-800 mb-4 font-[family:var(--font-heading)]">Ready to Get Started?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">Call us or use our online form to schedule your first appointment.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="tel:4423177000" class="btn-primary">📞 (442) 317-7000</a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-secondary">Request Appointment</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
